me?'\nYou say, 'help'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Seashells by the Seashore'.\nProvisioner Tarka says, 'Good, now do me a favor and get me as many of the shells as you can. If you find any pretty ones, collect those as well. Those we like to give to Chi to make as jewelry to sell to folks in Qeynos.'\n\n---\n\n**Task Window Text:** Provisioner Tarka is in need of some seashells that are located in the Cobalt Scar, amongst the restless ice. Search the shorelines for small seashells. Sirens and Neriads collect medium seashells, presumably for fashion. Large seashells are collected by the ulthorks and used as tools typically, but because they have been most taken by the ice, they have no need for the shells.\n01. Collect Small Seashells 0/10 Cobalt Scar\n\n\n\nSmall-Sized Restless Seashells [item=140065] are ground spawns along the edge of the beach.\n\n\n\n\nPut this in your cobaltscartwo\\_1.txt map file to find the seashells. They have a fast respawn.\n\n\n\n\nP 1284.6469, -722.9568, 58.3549, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 1244.3484, -104.3261, 66.6861, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 1139.2122, 117.8028, 57.1468, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 1006.1047, 483.0217, 65.6015, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 905.2831, 634.2330, 68.2489, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 741.7615, 681.4498, 58.4044, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 127.1435, 711.8127, 58.4113, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP -62.6435, 770.9047, 58.5624, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP -746.9645, 746.4496, 72.5468, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP -365.8491, 719.4419, 58.7903, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP -215.9385, 731.5972, 57.0404, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 301.1350, 758.4293, 56.7220, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 495.6748, 709.1525, 56.8961, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 1085.7750, 336.5470, 62.5018, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 1541.0151, -474.4386, 59.4009, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 1532.2341, -640.0653, 59.2248, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 1099.3217, -852.7788, 57.1871, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n05. Collect Medium Seashells 0/8 Cobalt Scar\n\n\n\n\n\nLoot Medium-Sized Restless Seashells [item=140227] from sirens and neriads.\n09. Collect Large Seashells 0/3 Cobalt Scar\n\n\n\nLoot Large-Sized Restless Seashells [item=140237] from Ulthorks.\n13. Deliver Small Seashells to Provisioner Tarka 0/10 Cobalt Scar\nProvisioner Tarka's voice is absolutely saturated with sarcasm, 'Great work! You picked up stuff on the ground! Nobody else but you could have done that!'\n19. Deliver Medium Seashells to Provisioner Tarka 0/8 Cobalt Scar\nProvisioner Tarka says, 'Braved the sirens and the mermaids did you? Well you're either brave or stupid, but I sure do appreciate you being either. Thank you.'\n25. Deliver Large Seashells to Provisioner Tarka 0/3 Cobalt Scar\n\n\n\nProvisioner Tarka says, 'I used to think all you adventurers are the same but having been helped by one of you has changed my views on you all. Thanks for this, it's good to know that there are some of you I can trust. Be safe out there and remember to cover your ears if you hear a siren's call, you don't want to end up like the ulthorks.'\n\nYour task 'Seashells by the Seashore' has been updated.\n_Tarka is pleased with your findings and will put thes shells you have gathered to good use. Chi will be pleased when she gets to sell them by the seashore in Qeunos._\nYou received 425 platinum.\nYou have gained 25 ability point(s)!\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nExp or AA\n425 platinum\n**Submitted by:** GOMN",
