ands you a note.\nYou are given Aisel's Note\n\n---\n\n**Task Window Text:** Aisel Sharpnose is an othmir of many words, just not many that are spoken. He appears to be planning something important to him and would like your help acquiring the item needed to do so.\nPaper is hard to come by in the Cobalt Scar, make sure that you sive Aisel back the note. It would be very rude for you not to.\n1\\. Give Aisel the note back 0/1 Cobalt Scar\nGive Aisel the note he handed to you.\nUpon hand in:\nYour task 'Catch and Release' has been updated.\nAisel Sharpnose accepts the note back and gives you a soft smile, as if to say \"I hope you do better than the others\".\n2\\. Find Aisle's Fishing pole 0/6 Cobalt Scar\n**Task Window Text:** Aisel believes that the fishing pole was last in the possession of his friend, who has presumably taken by the restless ice. Try to find the pole amongst the restless othmir.\nThe fishing pole will appear on your cursor after killing 6 restless othmir.\n_You have been given: Aisel's Favorite Fishing Pole_\n_That must have been Aisel's friend. Unfortunately, he was correct, but you were able to retrieve the fishing pole. This should be returned to Aisel immediately._\nYour task 'Catch and Release' has been updated.\n3\\. Return the fishing pole back to the right owner 0/1 Cobalt Scar\nReturn the pole back to Aisel.\n_You have been given: Aisel's Second Note_\n_Your task 'Catch and Release' has been updated._\n_Aisel Sharpnose seems shocked that you have returned. As you approach, he quickly scribbles something on the back side of the original note with a piece of charcoal._\n4\\. Locate Aisel's Fishing Lure 0/5 Cobalt Scar\n_The lure was presumably used to catch sharks, search the consents of the sharks stomachs in Cobalt Scar and see if you can locate the lure. The tackle box can be found at any fishing tackle vendors, assuming they are not sold out._\nThe Lure (Aisel's Favorite Fishing Lure) will appear on your cursor after killing 5 sharks.\n_You have been given: Aisel's Favorite Fishing Lure_\n_The last shark had a fishing lure with the letters ASL scratched onto it. This must be Aisel's lure!_\n5\\. Give Aisel his Fishing Lure Back 0/1 Cobalt Scar\n_Aisel is patiently waiting for the lure and tackle box in Cobalt's Scar._\nHand the lure back to Aisel.\n6\\. Give Aisel a Tackle Box 0/1 Cobalt Scar\n_Aisel is patiently waiting for the lure and tackle box in Cobalt's Scar._\nPurchase a tackle box from any vendor in-game and hand this in to Aisel\n_You have been given: Aisel's Gift for Stella_\nYour task 'Catch and Release' has been updated.\nAisel Sharpnose takes the tacklebox and the lure that you gave him and turns his back to you. You can see that he is fiddling with something. As you attempt to peek over his shoulder he notices, you and blocks your vision. After a few moments he turns and beams a huge smile at you. He then hands you a gift box with the name \"Stella Pidginsse\" on it and points to the west.\n7\\. Give the Gift to Stella 0/1 Cobalt Scar\n_The items were never meant for Aisel, he was going to give them to someone else, find Stella somewhere in the Cobalt Scar and deliver the gift to her._\nGive the gift to Stella Pidginsee on the far west side of the zone.\nYour task 'Catch and Release' has been updated.\n_Stella really enjoyed her gift from Aisel. The sweet gesture did not go unnoticed, you feel better having been a part of that exchange._\nYou receive 425 platinum.\nYou have gained 25 ability point(s)!\nStella Pidginsee takes the package with a curious and surprised look as she reads the tag and smiles warmly. She opens her hand and places the tips of the fingers against her chi. She drops her hand forward, palm up and mouths the words 'Thank you'.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n425 platinum\nExp or 25 AA at level 115\n**Submitted by:** GOMN",
