      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Cobalt Scar [CoV]\n**Who:**\n- De`ess Al'coda - CoV [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 113\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Al'coda's Seashell Earrings [item=140239]\n- Functional Othmir Fishing Pole [item=140235]\n- Sea-Soaked Necklace [item=140240]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Merien Gilfoyle [npc=56444]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Cobalt Scar (10 Points) [quest=10275]\n**Era:** | !Claws of Veeshan\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Oct 27 22:41:34 2020\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Claws of Veeshan Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n**Prerequisite Quests:** None.\nYou can obtain this quest from De`ess Al`coda in what was Siren's Grotto at 2387, 1475, 31. She is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, De`ess Al`coda'\nDe`ess Al`coda continues to hum as you approach her, only to be startled by your words, 'Oh, wow I wasn't expecting visitors.' Her voice is as soothing as you would expect a siren's to be, you remember that there is a reason that sailors fear them. 'Well, I can't very well turn away a guest! Welcome, and since you are here, would you mind helping us? There is a problem we are having with our [food source]\nYou say, ' Food...Source?'\nDe`ess Al`coda continues to speak, her voice is welcomed to your ears, especially after spending all of this time in dealing with the restless ice, 'Yes my friend, you see, the othmir out in the bay have been overfishing the bay, and because of this we have been slowly running out of our stock. Would you be a dear and [get rid] of them for us?'\nYou say, ' I would love to get rid of them for you?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Unchained Melody'.\nDe`ess Al`coda brushes your cheek and gently taps the side of your head in approval, \"Good Wood Elf, bring me their fishing poles to prove that you have done this. The othmir don't go anywhere without them, I'll be waiting here for your return.' You feel the need to do anything that De'ess Al'coda says, she makes you feel welcomed and it is a feeling you realize you haven't felt for a while. As you turn to leave, she says, 'Oh, and if you happen to find two small seashells, you will want to collect those as well, I need them for a special project.'\n\n---\n\n**Task Window Text:** You recall only De'ess Al'coda's face and voice but cannot recall much about what she was asking you to do. You resist the urge to go back to her and stay in her company, but what was it she wanted again?\nOh, right! The siren's food supply has been running out due to overfishing from the othmir, she needed you to take away their fishing poles. Unfortunately for the othmir, they don't part with their poles easily, you may have to take it from their cold, dead hands. You also remember that she asked for two small seashells\n01. Take the fishing poles away from the othmir 0/5 Cobalt Scar\n\n\n\nKill non-restless Othmir until you collect 5 Functional Othmir Fishing Pole\n05. Deliver the poles to De'ess 0/5 Cobalt Scar\n\n\n\n_Of course! Now that you have the fishing poles, she wanted you to give them to her as proof of your deeds. You don't want to keep her waiting!_\n\n\n\nDe`ess Al`coda looks more stunning than when you first approached her, you aren't sure what is different, but you are relieved she was still here, waiting for you. 'Oh, my goodness! Look at you, you poor little thing. You went through all this trouble having to deal with those hideous creatures for me? Bless your heart!'\n09. Deliver the seashells to De`ess 0/2 Cobalt Scar\n\n\n\n_That's right! You almost forgot you collected those seashells for her! She will be happy when you give them to her._\n\n\n\n\n\nCollect 2 Small-Sized Restless Seashells from the beach and deliver to De`ess..\n\n\n\n\nPut this in your cobaltscartwo\\_1.txt map file to find the seashells. They have a fast respawn.\n\n\n\n\nP 1284.6469, -722.9568, 58.3549, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 1244.3484, -104.3261, 66.6861, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 1139.2122, 117.8028, 57.1468, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 1006.1047, 483.0217, 65.6015, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 905.2831, 634.2330, 68.2489, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 741.7615, 681.4498, 58.4044, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 127.1435, 711.8127, 58.4113, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP -62.6435, 770.9047, 58.5624, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP -746.9645, 746.4496, 72.5468, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP -365.8491, 719.4419, 58.7903, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP -215.9385, 731.5972, 57.0404, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 301.1350, 758.4293, 56.7220, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 495.6748, 709.1525, 56.8961, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 1085.7750, 336.5470, 62.5018, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 1541.0151, -474.4386, 59.4009, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 1532.2341, -640.0653, 59.2248, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\nP 1099.3217, -852.7788, 57.1871, 0, 0, 0, 3, Seashell\n\n\n\n\nYour task 'Unchained Meolody' has been updated.\n\n\n_You have been given: Al`coda's Seasshell Earrings_\n\n10. Deliver the earrings to Merien Gilfoyle 0/1 Cobalt Scar\n\n\n\n_This time she asked you to simply deliver something to a mermaid somewhere in the grotto. You must find her and make the delivery. The sooner it is complete, the quicker you can go back to De`ess Al`coda._\n\n\n\nGive the earring to Merien Gilfoyle, who is right up the water tunnel above De`ess.\n\n\n\n\nYour task 'Unchained Melody' has been updated.\n\n\n\n\nMerien Gilfoyle looks astonished that you approached her without harming her, she appears to keep a cautious eye on you while you hand her the earrings. 'Oh!' she exclaims while looking relieved. 'De`ess sent you! That makes me feel much better about you finding me. Thank you for bringing these to me, they are fabulous! There is the problem with the deal her and I made, I seemed to have misplaced it.' She looks embarrassed, 'You see,' she gives another awkward laugh, 'anything that gets misplaced in the grotto can either be found amongst the othmir, the sharks, or the mimics. In this case, I believe the mimics have the necklace. You may need to search a few before you find it. They will be outside the cave entrance to the grotto. Bring me back the necklace to make sure you have the right one, those mimics will eat anything that is shiny.'\n14. Find the necklace amongst the mimics 0/5 Cobalt Scar\n\n\n\n_Merian.Gilfoyle, a mermaid who is in contact with De`ess, wants to replay the favor for the earrings by getting De`ess a trinket that was stolen by one of the mimics in Cobalt Scar._\n\n\n\nAfter killing the 5th Mimic (little animated boxes on the bed of the sea floor), a \"Sea-Soaked Necklace\" appears on your cursor.\n\n\n\n\n_You have been given: Sea-Soaked Necklace_\n18. Return the necklace to Merien 0/1 Cobalt Scar\n\n\n\n_Merien will want to inspect the necklace to ensure it is the correct one. Return the necklace to her._\n\n\n\nMerien Gilfoyle says, 'Perfect! That's the one! Here...' She hands back the necklace, 'Take it to De`ess, she's been waiting too long for it's return. She said it is a family heirloom and asked me to locate it for her, but I'm no fighter and those mimics bite hard. She will be happy to see it's returned [sic].\n\n\n\n\nShe will give the necklace back to you.\n22. Return the Necklace to De'ess 0/1 Cobalt Scar\n\n\n\n_De`ess is waiting for her necklace._\n\n\n\nDe`ess Al`coda entire [sic] complexion changes the moment you hand her the necklace. Her eyes are sunken, her skin looks darker, and she appears almost sinister. There is no way this is the same De`ess Al`coda that you met before, that isn't possible, there's no way she would be anything but breathtaking! As you try to get her attention, she hisses fiercely at you and for a moment you feel pure terror. You think it's best if you leave this creature and go find the real De`ess Al`coda.\n\n\n\n\nYour task 'Unchained melody' has been updated.\n\n\n\n\n_It's abundantly clear that De`ess is no longer in need of your services. Though you wonder if you will ever get to hear her voice again._\n\n\n\nYou gain 425 platinum.\n\n\nYou have gained 25 ability point(s)!\n\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nEXP or AA\n425 platinum.\n**Submitted by:** GOMN",
